libdvbcsa ICAM (VideoGuard CSA-ALT) support

- dvbcsa_bs_key_set_ecm(ecm, cw, key): ecm = 4 selects the ICAM block cipher
  key (CW bytes 0 and 4 bit permuted), any other value is standard CSA
- dvbcsa_bs_key_set() and dvbcsa_key_schedule_block() share the code path
  with the _ecm variants instead of duplicating it
- DVBCSA_KEY_ECM in dvbcsa/dvbcsa.h for compile time detection
- test/testecm is run by "make check"

